[[Lipids List]
Domain  0  
;lipidnname ratio_up ratio_down  APL
POPC	0.8  0.8  0.64
CDL0	0.2  0.2  1.2
End

[Shape Data]
; Information regarding the dimensions of the shape we want to simulate. This is the same information as is normally generated during the Pointillism PLM step.
ShapeType 1D_PBC_Fourier
Box        30   15   20
WallRange  0    1    0    1
Density    3    1
Thickness  4
Mode 0.5    1    0
Mode 2    2    0
End
